Bug Report: Incorrect Payment Error Message

Project: Konga Selenium Automation Project

Module: Payment

Bug Title: Incorrect error message displayed for an invalid payment method

Steps to Reproduce:

1. Open the Konga website.
2. Add a product to the cart.
3. Proceed to checkout.
4. Try an invalid payment method.
5. Observe the displayed error message.

Expected Result: The system should display an error indicating that the payment method is invalid.

Actual Result: The system displays “You have exceeded your daily transaction limit.”

Status: Under Investigation

Severity: To be confirmed

Evidence: Screenshot of the error message, if available.

Note: Verify that the daily transaction limit was not genuinely exceeded before confirming this as a defect.
